$ORIGIN home.test.
$TTL 30
@        IN SOA ns.hlspike.test. admin.hlspike.test. 1 7200 3600 1209600 30
@        IN NS  ns.hlspike.test.
; Like classic's DNS zone: one wildcard CNAME to the proxy cluster. It also answers
; validation.home.test, the name NetBird checks before it accepts the custom domain.
*        IN CNAME proxy.hlspike.test.
